  "review_correction": "Read-only review found appended virtual members were incorrectly counted against the existing logical256 source width. Separate private retained-member slots are now bounded at256 independently, with real allocation charges; native virtual-slot accounting and public logical policy remain unchanged. Independent wide129 aliases plus finalX128.Value and logical256/257 controls pass. Frozen old CLI default wide baseline was checked-refused, so no prior end-to-end wide CLI success is claimed.",
